The '''Goblin''' is a type of [[Mob]] and [[Goblin (disambiguation)|Goblin]] that spawns in the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Goblins''' spawn throughout the {{Zone|Goblin Burrows}} in the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}}.

== Behavior ==
'''Goblins''' move around slowly and target players with slow melee attacks.

== Drops ==
'''Goblins''' have a {{odds|rare|nameonly=y}} ({{Green|5%}}) chance to drop a bag of coins holding {{c|500|10000}}. The player will be notified in the chat over the drop and the amount.
